    "dynamic_rich_text_br77Mw": {
      "type": "dynamic-rich-text",
      "name": "t:sections.rich_text.presets.rich_text.name",
      "settings": {
        "width": "full-width",
        "title": "Monster Piercing | Circular/Horseshoe Barbells",
        "text": "<p>Horseshoe barbells, also referred to as circular barbells, are among the most versatile pieces of body jewellery available. Their distinct open-ended design, which resembles a horseshoe, makes them suitable for a variety of piercings, including septum, lip, eyebrow, and even nipple piercings. At Monster Piercing, our collection of horseshoe barbells comes in various sizes, materials, and styles to cater to different tastes and needs. Available in surgical steel, titanium, and gold, our horseshoe barbells are designed to ensure long-lasting wear and minimal irritation. What sets these barbells apart is the removable ends, which can be switched between balls, spikes, or other decorative attachments, allowing for easy customisation and frequent style changes. The curvature of the barbell ensures a comfortable fit in piercings that follow the natural curve of the body, while the secure threaded ends provide peace of mind for daily wear. Whether you’re looking for something simple and understated or bold and decorative, our horseshoe barbells provide a flexible and stylish option for multiple piercings.</p>",
        "heading_size": "medium",
        "text_alignment": "center"
      }
    },
