        "question_E8HPew": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is a CBB (circular barbell)?",
            "answer": "<p>A CBB, also known as a <strong>circular barbell</strong> or <strong>horseshoe ring</strong>, is a versatile piece of body jewellery shaped like a semi-circle with removable ball or decorative ends. It’s ideal for many piercings including septum, helix, daith, lobe, eyebrow, lip, and nipple piercings.</p>",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "question_ir3CFG": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What materials are your circular barbells made from?",
            "answer": "<p>We offer CBBs in <strong>implant-grade titanium</strong>, <strong>solid gold</strong>, <strong>925 sterling silver</strong>, and <strong>316L surgical steel</strong>. Each material is crafted for durability, comfort, and long-lasting shine. Our titanium and gold options are hypoallergenic and suitable for sensitive skin.</p>",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "question_wKV8aq": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do your circular barbells have removable ends?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. All our CBBs come with removable ends that can be unscrewed for easy insertion and cleaning. Depending on the design, the ends may feature <strong>plain balls</strong>, <strong>spikes</strong>, or <strong>gem-set tops</strong>.</p>",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "question_iwBHRw": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I wear a circular barbell in different piercings?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. CBBs are one of the most versatile styles of body jewellery. They can be used in <strong>septum, daith, rook, eyebrow, lip, nipple, and ear piercings</strong>. Always make sure to use the correct gauge and diameter for your anatomy.</p>",
            "icon": "none"
